            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng 4seasons Vinwonder",
            "review_text": "Jet56694163656\n1 contribution\n0\nAbsolutely,Terrible Food\nJan 2025 • Family\nToday my family and I had went to this restaurant or atleast we thought we were and poor us because as soon as we had entered the establishment now the reason we had to come to the restaurant was because we saw all the different iteams on the menu but little did we know theres a reason why there were alot of tables full but for all of the wrong reasons! As soon as we had entered the restaurant we werent able to sit down right away to begin to start choosing our items to eat instead we had to spend 5-10 minutes cleaning the table which we shouldnt have been doing and the Workers should have! So after a few minutes of cleaning the table we had finally sat down, now the table in front of us i saw was complaining tot he workers which in hindsight i should have taken as a warning to run from the restaurant but i had brushed it off as a coincidence.. So after we had finished ordering all our food we then had to wait ... MORE THAN 30 MINUTES!! We hadnt even ordered that much food I had ordered the Spaghetti which for some reason was on the menu in a Vietnamese styled restaurant which i had to wait ANOTHER 30 MINUTES FOR! So after waiting A WHOLE HOUR for i was so excited to bite in to my delicious food but unfortunately it was everything but delicious and food.. So when i had bit into my food and smelt it i thought this food might be really good! But as i bit in to my food.. IT WAS COLD AS IF THEY HAD MICROWAVED IT!! If you ever decide to come to this restaurant I should advise please bring food from home its the better option! 😀\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 31, 2025",
